age":"https://cdn6.albox.co/storage/disk43/shows/79ef48f4-8258-41ab-90cd-def80b54f798.jpg","background_image":"https://cdn6.albox.co/storage/disk44/shows/cfe0656a-0194-41f2-93d5-cf63e2493b92.jpg","likes":1374,"dislikes":68,"views":172225,"release_date":"485568000000","length":5759,"description":"John Rambo is removed from prison by his former superior, Colonel Samuel Troutman, for a top-secret operation to bring back POW's still held in Vietnam. Rambo's assignment is to only take pictures of where the POWs are being held, but Rambo wants to get the POWs out of Vietnam. Teamed up with female Vietnamese freedom fighter Co Bao, Rambo embarks on a mission to rescue the POWs, who are being held by sadistic Vietnamese Captain Vinh and his Russian comrade, Lieutenant Colonel Padovsky. Rambo starts killing every enemy in sight while still focusing on his intentions to rescue the POWs. There are also corrupt American officials involved in the mission, including Marshall Murdock, one of Rambo's superiors.","rating":{"sources":[{"title":"IMDb","logo":"https://a7.pnghunt.com/preview/450/662/555/computer-wallpaper-text-brand-yellow-imdb.jpg","max_value":10,"value":6.4}],"value":6.4,"age":"R"},"episode_id":7518,"content_control":"NORMAL"}}